// Power : Corruption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3377876385" "Corruption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P383811230" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Fire), Foe Minor DoT (Toxic), -Res"
// Power Help Text :
"P1035316070" "You lash out with your whip, firing a bolt of hellfire and corrupting your victim's very living essence. This attack deals minor fire damage, causes minor toxic damage over time, and reduces their damage resistance for a short time. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
